e)  Verify that the work within their responsibilities is carried out efficiently and effectively in accordance with applicable laws, 
regulations and instructions;
f)  Take into account that the delegation of their responsibilities is to persons who have the competence and authority for the 
tasks delegated to them, without disclaiming their responsibility for those actions;
g)  Exercise due diligence to protect the interests of clients and treat them in a fair manner;
h)  Observe disclosure and transparency in making the necessary information available to clients;
i)  Work on preventing any conflict of interest situations.

